# GardenMitra Environment Configuration
# All configurations are optional and privacy-preserving.
# GardenMitra functions completely local-first without mandatory external accounts.

# Local Vision AI Integration (Milestone 4 & Milestone 8)
# If running Ollama locally for on-device multimodal vision inference:
VITE_OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
VITE_OLLAMA_MODEL=gemma3:latest

# Weather Provider (Milestone 7)
# GardenMitra uses the free public Open-Meteo API (https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast)
# No API key is required.
